# The repo is LF-only. Lovable writes LF; tooling on Windows can silently
# rewrite whole files to CRLF, which turns the next Lovable push into a
# whole-file diff and a painful merge. Normalise on the way in.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets must never be touched.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.webp binary
*.avif binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ico binary
*.pdf binary
